The flex container element can have the following properties:

Theflex-directionproperty specifies the display-direction of flex items in the flex container.

This property can have one of the following values:

Theflex-wrapproperty specifies whether the flex items should wrap or not, 
if there is not enough room for them on one flex line.

This property can have one of the following values:

Theflex-flowproperty is a shorthand property for setting both theflex-directionandflex-wrapproperties.

